# Supply-chain cooldown: refuse any package version published less than 7 days
# ago (install-time gate, requires npm >= 11.10 — older npm silently ignores
# this key, so CI upgrades npm before install). Lockfile-pinned versions are
# unaffected; only new/updated resolutions are gated.
# Urgent bypass for a vetted security patch:
#   npm install <pkg>@<version> --min-release-age=0
min-release-age=7
